        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alien fleet pierces the atmosphere, its warships blotting out the sun. Cities crumble, defenses fall, and the planet teeters on the brink of annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are humanity’s last line of defense. One pilot. One ship. One chance to turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbital Siege</strong> fuses the classic arcade shooters with planetary defense, delivering relentless action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔥 Intense Shoot-'em-up Action:</strong> Survive escalating enemy waves and take down bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚙️ Upgrade &amp; Defend:</strong> Boost firepower, speed, and shields with power-ups. Block enemy fire with defensive orbs, hunt foes with devastating lasers and homing missiles, and activate planetary turrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎯 Dodge &amp; Weave:</strong> Slip through storms of enemy fire with sharp precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎨 Pixel Retro Style:</strong> Vibrant pixel art that celebrates the golden age of arcade gaming.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alien fleet pierces the atmosphere, its warships blotting out the sun. Cities crumble, defenses fall, and the planet teeters on the brink of annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are humanity’s last line of defense. One pilot. One ship. One chance to turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbital Siege</strong> fuses the classic arcade shooters with planetary defense, delivering relentless action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔥 Intense Shoot-'em-up Action:</strong> Survive escalating enemy waves and take down bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚙️ Upgrade &amp; Defend:</strong> Boost firepower, speed, and shields with power-ups. Block enemy fire with defensive orbs, hunt foes with devastating lasers and homing missiles, and activate planetary turrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎯 Dodge &amp; Weave:</strong> Slip through storms of enemy fire with sharp precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎨 Pixel Retro Style:</strong> Vibrant pixel art that celebrates the golden age of arcade gaming.</p>",
